        "lead_id": "activity-lead--etda--bcea7a562408575ebff0",
        "name": "The first known Suckfly campaign began in April of 2014. During our investigation of the campaign, we identified a number of global targets across several industries who were attacked in 2015. Many of the targets we identified were well known commercial organizations located in India.",
